PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
  L2: Two Nearby Points
    - p and q marked with filled circles
  L3: Holonomy Loops
    - Loop at p (green)
    - Loop at q (green)
  L4: Vector Transport
    - v transported around loop at p → v_p'
    - v transported around loop at q → v_q'
    - v_p' and v_q' shown in red (#FF0000FF)
  L5: Drift Visualization
    - Arrow showing difference between v_p' and v_q'
    - Labeled "Holonomy Drift"
  L6: Labels
    - "H = Hol(p) − Hol(q)"
    - "Holonomy Drift Tensor"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
